SUMMARY:Tech Toolbox: Google Docs Basics
DESCRIPTION:Tech Toolbox is a free hands-on workshop series focused on 
 building real\, practical digital skills. Each session zeroes in on a 
 specific skill\, program\, or tool—from core computer skills and file 
 management to navigating software and online platforms you use every day. 
 Participants are encouraged to bring their own devices and follow along\, 
 so you'll leave each session having actually practiced what you 
 learned.\n\nAll experience levels are welcome\, and your instructor will be 
 there to walk you through everything step by step. Sessions are free and 
 open to the public.\n\nThis week's topic is: Google Docs Basics\n(try to 
 bring a laptop or tablet if possible\, and know your Gmail   password!)
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Computers & Technology
