SUMMARY:Teatro Nuovo Presents Bel Canto Notturno
DESCRIPTION:This program is made possible through the generous support of 
 an Anonymous donor and Rosemary Iversen.\n\n \n\nA staple of chamber music 
 in the late Classical and early Romantic era (circa 1780-1830) was the 
 Italian "Notturno" for two voices with continuo or fully-composed keyboard 
 part. Join us for an enchanting hour of Bel Canto harmony 
 featuring:\n\nAmalia Crevani\, soprano\n\nEmily Hughes\, 
 mezzo-soprano\n\nMatt Zucker\, cello\n\nWill Crutchfield\, fortepiano\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Main - Green Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Books, Film & Theater, Music, Performance, Special Event
UID:LibCal-10306-17230179
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17230179
END:VEVENT
