SUMMARY:A 250th Birthday Party for the Declaration of Independence: Read-Aloud\, Talk and Cake NEW
DESCRIPTION:Let's celebrate the 250th birthday of the Declaration of 
 Independence! We'll enjoy a student read-aloud of the Declaration and a 
 45-minute talk by former history professor Steve Golin about the influence 
 and meaning today of this iconic American proclamation. We'll wind up our 
 celebration with\, of course\, cake! Co-sponsored by the League of Women 
 Voters of the Montclair Area.
