SUMMARY:Book Talk: Field Guide to North American Words by Tina Kelley
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Book Talk with author Tina Kelley.\n\nTina 
 Kelley’s fifth poetry collection\, Field Guide to North American Words\, 
 came out this spring from Jacar Press\, joining Rise Wildly\, Abloom & 
 Awry\, from CavanKerry Press\, and Precise and The Gospel of Galore\, 
 winner of a Washington State Book Award. A former New York Times reporter\, 
 she is the co-author of two nonfiction books\, and she and her husband have 
 two children and live in Maplewood\, NJ. She’s on Facebook\, BlueSky\, 
 x.com\, and Instagram. \n\n \n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
