SUMMARY:Garden Qigong at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. \n\nJoin us to explore 
 Qigong in the Van Vleck gardens as we transition from summer to autumn. 
 Learn to move with gracefulness and joy while remaining centered and 
 rooted. This 6-week class highlights the gentle rhythms of Qigong by 
 slowing down\, listening and mind/body peacefulness. Come pay attention to 
 your senses as we move with care\, cultivate attention and let each breath 
 carry us home. \n\n \n
LOCATION:Montclair - Van Vleck House & Gardens\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Personal Growth, Health & Wellness
