SUMMARY:Drop-In Tech Help
DESCRIPTION:Bring your personal device to the library to receive one-on-one 
 assistance with everyday technology issues. We can answer your questions\, 
 help resolve a tech challenge\, and connect you with more resources and 
 programs at the library and beyond.\n\nThis hour is drop-in and first 
 come\, first served. This hour is best suited for quick tech questions.\n
