SUMMARY:Tech Toolbox: Locking Down Your Accounts
DESCRIPTION:Tech Toolbox is a free hands-on workshop series focused on 
 building real\, practical digital skills. Each session zeroes in on a 
 specific skill\, program\, or tool—from core computer skills and file 
 management to navigating software and online platforms you use every day. 
 Participants are encouraged to bring their own devices and follow along\, 
 so you'll leave each session having actually practiced what you 
 learned.\n\nAll experience levels are welcome\, and your instructor will be 
 there to walk you through everything step by step. Sessions are free and 
 open to the public.\n\nThis week's topic is: Locking Down Your Accounts
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-16825642
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16825642
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260929T193000Z
DTEND:20260929T201500Z
DTSTAMP:20260929T000000Z
SUMMARY:Tech Talks: What the Internet Knows About You
DESCRIPTION:Tech Talks is a free informational series where library staff 
 introduce and explain the technology topics that matter most in today's 
 digital world. Each session takes a closer look at a new or complex 
 topic—whether it's a trending app\, an emerging technology\, or a 
 platform you've been hearing about but aren't quite sure how to navigate. 
 Through demonstrations and clear\, jargon-free explanations\, you'll come 
 away with a better understanding of the tech landscape around you. There's 
 no hands-on component\, so no devices are needed—just come ready to learn 
 and ask questions.\n\nAll are welcome regardless of experience level\, and 
 time is reserved at the end of each session for Q&A. Sessions are free and 
 open to the public.\n\nThis week's topic is: What the Internet Knows About 
 You
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-16825383
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16825383
