SUMMARY:Music of Spain and Latin America: A Free Live Classical Guitar Concert NEW
DESCRIPTION:Join guitarist Dan Garcia for an intimate celebration of the 
 passionate and diverse sounds of Spanish and Latin American classical 
 guitar\, featuring works by composers such as Francisco Tárrega\, Isaac 
 Albéniz\, Joaquín Rodrigo\, Heitor Villa-Lobos\, and Agustín Barrios 
 Mangoré\, among others. Expect an authentic journey through the regional 
 flavors of flamenco-influenced pieces\, romantic Spanish works\, and the 
 vibrant rhythms of Latin America.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Lectures / History & Culture, Music
