SUMMARY:*NEW DATE* English for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) - Beginner to Intermediate
DESCRIPTION:NEW DATE: ESOL will run from Wednesday\, October 28-Wednesday\, 
 December 9. Class will not meet on October 21\, as the library will be 
 closed. We apologize for any confusion with the date change.\n\nEnglish for 
 Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) - Beginner to Intermediate is designed 
 to assist adult students in mastering the English language by emphasizing 
 speaking\, listening\, reading\, and writing skills. \n\nStudents should 
 bring their own notebook and pencils for note taking.\n\nRegistration is 
 required. Please notify us at adultprograms@montclairlibrary.org if you are 
 going to miss class. If you do not attend the classes without notifying 
 us\, you will not be allowed to register for our next English class.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
